    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this impressive two-bedroom penthouse apartment, superbly positioned on Lord Edward Street in the heart of Dublin city centre, between Dublin Castle and Christ Church Cathedral. Recently renovated and stylishly furnished, this distinctive top-floor property features soaring ceiling heights, extensive skylights, dual-aspect accommodation, two balconies and a designated parking space.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is exceptionally bright and well proportioned. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a generous open-plan living and dining room, an impressive space enhanced by timber flooring, dramatic ceiling height and an abundance of natural light. Doors open onto a balcony enjoying wonderful views towards Christ Church Cathedral and across the Dublin city skyline.\r\n\r\nA separate kitchen is positioned just off the living space and is finished with sleek dark cabinetry, tiled flooring, excellent storage and a large window providing additional natural light.\r\n\r\nThere are two generous bedrooms. The main bedroom is a particularly spacious double with built-in wardrobes, a large window and en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom is also a comfortable double and benefits from direct access to the second balcony, while offering excellent flexibility for use as a guest room or home office. A stylish main bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nOne of the apartment’s most striking features is its exceptional sense of volume, with ceiling heights extending to approximately 3.90m at their highest point. Combined with multiple Velux windows, the dual aspect and top-floor position, this creates a wonderfully light and airy interior that is unusual for a city-centre apartment.\r\n\r\nA superb penthouse offering generous accommodation, outdoor space, parking and impressive city views in an exceptionally convenient Dublin city centre location just minutes walk from Grafton Street.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Available from 1st October.\r\nTwo bedroom penthouse\r\nRecently renovated.\r\nTwo bathrooms, including main en-suite.\r\nDual aspect with two private balconies.\r\nCity views over Lord Edward Street and towards Christ Church Cathedral.\r\nHigh ceilings throughout.\r\nVelux windows fill interior with natural light\r\nSeparate fully fitted kitchen.\r\nDesignated parking space if required.\r\nStylishly furnished.\r\nWell connected with Dublin Bus routes on its doorstep.\r\nPrime city centre location between Dublin Castle and Christ Church Cathedral."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E1"
      }
